on","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:c1e0e614dc81fa4185884a76d90adc9dce617afceaf945d8aacfb6aecdc8797e","file":"preprints/Tracial-projection-methods-and-uniform-property-Gamma-September-23-2026/build/sections/01_introduction.tex","line":57,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"d0b8857d0be8f6ff308336b1fd69d0bb478706f979c4d8677432fba7d7117df8","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Tracial-projection-methods-and-uniform-property-Gamma-September-23-2026/build/sections/01_introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:c1e0e614dc81fa4185884a76d90adc9dce617afceaf945d8aacfb6aecdc8797e","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Tracial-projection-methods-and-uniform-property-Gamma-September-23-2026/build/sections/01_introduction.tex#L57"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{r:thm:main}\nLet $A$ be a unital, separable, simple, infinite-dimensional, nuclear,\nstably finite $C^*$-algebra with $T(A)\\ne\\varnothing$, and let\n$B=\\overline A^{T(A)}$. Fix any free ultrafilter $\\omega$ on $\\N$.\nIf $B^\\omega$ has real rank zero in its quotient $C^*$-norm, then there is\na projection $p\\in B^\\omega\\cap B'$ such that\n\\[\n \\lambda(px)=\\tfrac12\\lambda(x)\n \\qquad(x\\in B,\\ \\lambda\\in\\Lambda_\\omega).\n\\]\nIn particular, $A$ has uniform property $\\Gamma$."}
